  "outlook_text": "“Third quarter results demonstrated the resilience of our business as benefits from our strategic initiatives, diligent cost management, and lower employee-related costs generated solid profitability and cash flow performance,” stated Steven B. Hedlund, President and Chief Executive Officer. “During the quarter we initiated broader cost saving measures to address slowing organic sales trends, while investing in long-term growth and operational excellence, which will position the Company to outperform through the cycle.”"
